  #line-at(111.02pt, 310.37pt, "First, the temporal evolution and spatial profile of temperature predictions from the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 341.57pt, "proposed ETCM are compared with those from a conventional MHTM in Fig. 2(a) and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 372.77pt, "Fig.2 (b). While both models reproduce the overall temperature evolution, pronounced ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 403.97pt, "discrepancies are observed in the absolute temperature values. These deviations ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 435.17pt, "originate from the MHTM’s neglect of electromagnetic wave propagation and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 466.39pt, "interference within individual layers")
