  #line-at(90.024pt, 419.57pt, "flux maximum into deeper layers. This interference-driven photothermal response leads ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 450.79pt, "to a fundamental trade-off in multilayer design: while increasing the period number is ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 481.99pt, "essential for achieving high reflectivity, it simultaneously enhances temperature by ")
